#: heating_emissions/components/gridded_emissions_artifact.py:103
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Estimated {emission_type} greenhouse gas emissions from heating residential buildings.\n"
"\n"
"This includes all greenhouse gases (carbon dioxide, methane, F-gases, etc.) emitted directly from buildings, as well "
"as emitted at power plants that generate electricity for heat pumps, or that heat water delivered to residences "
"through district heating networks. Emissions associated to the upstream extraction and processing of fuels are also "
"included.\n"
"\n"
"Results are based on data from the 2022 German census."
msgstr ""

